,"r20_spy":-0.0848}}],"quotes":[{"c":"ET 2018 Q4","e":"et","d":"2019-02-21","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Dennis Coleman","x":"You talked about some higher tariffs on Transwestern, Panhandle, and Trunkline, I think as a result of Rover coming on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/energy-transferut-ltd-partn-int-et-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q1","e":"et","d":"2019-05-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Long","x":"And in April, we announced a non-binding open season to solicit shipper interest for expanded joint tariff transportation service received from certain connecting carriers onto Bayou Bridge pipeline system.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/09/energy-transfer-lp-et-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q1","e":"et","d":"2019-05-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marshall S. McCrea","x":"As Tom mentioned, there's so much potential in China and it's going to happen, it's just -- but with tariffs kind of slowing things down, it's not moving as quickly as we all would like both us and the Chinese companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/09/energy-transfer-lp-et-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q2","e":"et","d":"2019-08-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Thomas Long","x":"And as soon as the tariffs were lifted, we expect to move forward hopefully on other projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/energy-transfer-lp-et-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q2","e":"et","d":"2019-08-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Long","x":"So, this isn't a matter of just pushing some of the cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/energy-transfer-lp-et-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q3","e":"et","d":"2019-11-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Marshall S. McCrea","x":"As we know the tariff issue has kind of put things on hold as far as finalizing deals but it hasn't put on the hold discussions negotiations and ongoing opportunities to expand our ethane export capability and we do expect that to happen.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/energy-transfer-lp-et-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q3","e":"et","d":"2019-11-07","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Pearce Hammond","x":"And do you see other potential opportunities similar to that that you might be able to sign up here especially if the tariff war with China gets resolved?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/energy-transfer-lp-et-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q3","e":"et","d":"2019-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Long","x":"Also we expect operating cost savings of $40 million from the elimination of duplicative public company costs and increased efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/energy-transfer-lp-et-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q3","e":"et","d":"2019-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Lapides","x":"First can you talk about especially on the gas and NGL side counterparty exposure and counterparty risk I mean obviously you've got a small customer on Rover who is going through restructuring of some kind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/energy-transfer-lp-et-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2019 Q4","e":"et","d":"2020-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Long","x":"…at corporate cost, we are on track to recognize savings of more than $40 million annually from a reduction in headcount and increased efficiencies and we continue to work toward achieving approximately $80 million of commercial and operational synergies which are expected to be driven by our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/energy-transfer-lp-et-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q1","e":"et","d":"2020-05-11","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Lapides","x":"Can you break that large piece of the pie into what percent of that is take or pay and what percent of that is you've got the fee or the tariff set but you've got volumetric exposure?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/energy-transfer-lp-et-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q1","e":"et","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Long","x":"These include cost reduction measures and reduced 2020 growth capex expenditures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/energy-transfer-lp-et-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q1","e":"et","d":"2020-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas E. Long","x":"In addition, due to this pressure on our business, we have identified and are executing on significant cost-cutting initiatives both in our corporate offices, as well as our field operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/energy-transfer-lp-et-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q2","e":"et","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Long","x":"As we mentioned on our last call, we have undertaken cost-reduction measures, both in our corporate offices, as well as our field operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/energy-transfer-lp-et-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q2","e":"et","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Long","x":"And we now expect to achieve cost savings of approximately $400 million for full-year 2020 relative to our budget.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/06/energy-transfer-lp-et-q2-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q3","e":"et","d":"2020-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Long","x":"Looking more closely at our cost reduction measures which are under way in our corporate offices, as well as at our field operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/energy-transfer-lp-et-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q3","e":"et","d":"2020-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Long","x":"And for full-year 2020, we now expect to achieve cost savings of over $500 million relative to our original budget.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/energy-transfer-lp-et-q3-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q4","e":"et","d":"2021-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Long","x":"The combination of energy transfers and Enable's complementary assets will allow the combined company to leverage its intensive infrastructure to pursue additional commercial opportunities and achieve cost savings while enhancing our ability to serve customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/17/energy-transfer-lp-et-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ET 2020 Q4","e":"et","d":"2021-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Long","x":"As we discussed on previous calls, during 2020, we implemented cost reduction measures throughout our corporate offices and field operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/17/energy-transfer-lp-et-q4-2020-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ET 2021 Q1","e":"et","d":"2021-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Long","x":"In April, we announced that we will post a joint tariff for crude oil transportation service to move ET and third-party Powder River and DJ Basin barrels through our Cushing and White Cliffs Pipeline to our Nederland terminal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/energy-transfer-lp-et-q1-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"ET 2021 Q1","e":"et","d":"2021-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom Long","x":"Joint tariff service is expected to commence by June 1 of this year.","url":"https:/